================================================================================
ALGORITHMS IMPLEMENTED FROM PUBLISHED DESCRIPTIONS
================================================================================

  src/hearwrite/features.py implements Whisper's log mel feature extraction
  (80 mel bins, 400 sample window, hop 160, Slaney scale filterbank, Whisper's
  particular clamping and rescaling) from its published definition, in numpy.
  No OpenAI code is copied. The filterbank is verified identical to
  faster-whisper's independent implementation, and that check is a test.

  src/hearwrite/engines/whisper.py implements LocalAgreement, described in
  "Turning Whisper into Real-Time Transcription System" (Machacek, Dabre,
  Bojar, 2023). No code from whisper_streaming or SimulStreaming is copied.


